    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">20 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Two pointers</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Greedy branch once</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/valid-palindrome-ii/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 680</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Valid Palindrome II</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Walk two pointers inward while the characters match. At the first mismatch the one allowed deletion must remove one of those two characters, so try both: is <code>s[lo+1..hi]</code> or <code>s[lo..hi-1]</code> a palindrome? O(n) time, O(1) space, and a Meta favourite.</p>\n"
